NAME='Uranus'
COVER_SUB='What awakens a generation, about seven years in each sign.'
T=[
('1928–35 · 2011–19','Uranus in Aries gives originality, eccentricity, independence and a restless need to act. You are strongly reactive and surprise people with lightning decisions and a vibrant, hurried temperament. Pioneers and rebels are born here, quick to break with tradition and start from zero. Uranus is dynamic and unpredictable by nature, and in Aries nothing slows it down. Karmic reading: a generation that came to open new paths and was never meant to follow old ones. The shadow is impulsiveness and impatience with others. The lesson: freedom works better with follow-through.'),
('1935–42 · 2019–26','Uranus in Taurus is in its fall, and the sign does not let it express its best. An imperious dominant tendency leads to excess in every field, but you are strongly determined and do not retreat before any obstacle. There are intuitions in high finance, leadership gifts, a love of art and a taste for the new in the material world. Money, land, food and the body are shaken and reinvented. Karmic reading: a generation learning that security is something you build, not something you inherit. The shadow is stubborn resistance to change. The lesson: let go of one comfort.'),
('1942–49 · 2026–33','Uranus in Gemini, with harmonious aspects, gives initiative, a sense of opportunity and an interest in everything new and unusual. Mental activity is considerable, with the gift of analysis and synthesis, strong intuition and curiosity that ranges across many branches of knowledge. Language, media, technology and learning change at speed, and thought runs in networks and quick exchanges. Karmic reading: a generation here to reinvent how people understand each other. The shadow is nervous restlessness and scattered attention. The lesson: depth is also a kind of originality.'),
('1949–56','Uranus in Cancer, in the Moon’s house, is not in a favourable position and cannot express its best. Yet it raises sensitivity and intuition, and gives marked psychic faculties. Sudden, unforeseeable events bring a favourable change of situation. This generation grew up as traditional households changed and questions arose about family, belonging and nationality. Karmic reading: a generation re-making the meaning of home. The shadow is emotional instability and unpredictable moods. The lesson: you can be free and still belong.'),
('1956–62','Uranus in Leo, the Sun’s sign, gives overflowing physical and mental activity, inventive genius and personal magnetism. You are ambitious, optimistic and generous, born to command: an electric leader with original ideas, hard to distract once a goal is set. Individual creativity comes into the open, with self-expression, originality and personal freedom as values. Karmic reading: a generation learning to shine without needing applause. The shadow is a rigid ego and the inability to judge calmly. The lesson: your light is stronger when it is shared.'),
('1962–69','Uranus in Virgo, with positive aspects, gives practical sense, intuition and skill in business. Intellectually gifted, you are inclined toward scientific research, literature and medicine, with an ingenious spirit. It reinvents work, health and daily routine, from technology in the workplace to new ways of caring for the body. Uranus here is nighttime Mercury’s house and its mind is exact. Karmic reading: a generation that serves by improving systems. The shadow is nervous perfectionism. The lesson: a better method still needs a human touch.'),
('1969–75','Uranus in Libra, with harmonious aspects, gives intelligence and strong imagination. Personal charm helps in relationships and social life. There is a love of freedom and an agitated emotional life, with a predisposition and love for art in all its expressions: painting, sculpture, music and literature. This generation questioned what partnership means and reshaped relationships, law and fairness. Karmic reading: a generation learning to be free inside a bond. The shadow is a fear of commitment. The lesson: freedom and loyalty can live together.'),
('1975–81','Uranus in Scorpio, when harmonious, gives a profound intelligence, a fervid imagination and an inventive spirit. There is a continual search for novelty and the sensational and an escape from the everyday, with exceptional learning and an attraction to strange, unusual and hidden things. Sexuality, power, money shared with others and taboos are shaken. Karmic reading: a generation that came to transform what had been buried. The shadow is a drive toward upheaval for its own sake. The lesson: transformation without destruction is possible.'),
('1981–88','Uranus in Sagittarius, in Jupiter’s house, with harmonious aspects, gives intelligence, open-mindedness, marked intuition, a high moral sense and spiritual tendencies. You are an idealist with good sociological and political aptitudes, and a talent for teaching in religious, metaphysical and esoteric fields. Beliefs, travel and higher education are reinvented. Karmic reading: a generation looking for a truth broader than inherited dogma. The shadow is fanaticism and restlessness. The lesson: freedom of thought includes the freedom to doubt.'),
('1988–95','Uranus in Capricorn, when harmonious, marks an individualist who is independent, self-reliant and poorly suited to life in community, with difficulties in married life. A misanthropic spirit seeks solitude to study abstract matters such as astrology, psychology, philosophy and the occult. Governments, institutions and structures are shaken from within. Karmic reading: a generation that came to rebuild the rules. The shadow is cold detachment. The lesson: authority can be reinvented without being destroyed.'),
('1995–2003','Uranus is at home in Aquarius and expresses its qualities in full. You have a strong personality, a bursting will and a lightning capacity to decide. You are drawn to everything bizarre, new and uncommon, and turn toward scientific research, religious studies and the esoteric. This generation grew up with the internet and collective technology. Karmic reading: a generation here to serve humanity’s future. The shadow is stubborn rebellion and emotional distance. The lesson: a better world needs the person beside you.'),
('2003–11','Uranus in Pisces, with harmonious aspects, gives an inventive spirit. You are a dreamer who avoids physical effort, with little ambition, but with a heightened sensitivity that inclines toward esoteric sciences, secret research and astrology. There is personal magnetism and great intuition. This generation grew up as the boundary between the real and the virtual began to dissolve. Karmic reading: a generation learning to dream with its eyes open. The shadow is escapism. The lesson: compassion needs a way to act.'),
]
